OL,3,AParents live in fear paedophile nursery
OL,4,Aworker harmed their children
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents are calling for mandatory CCTV
OL,7,Fin nurseries after a worker who looked
OL,8,Fafter their children was later exposed
OL,9,Fas a paedophile.
OL,11,FNathan Bennett was jailed in February
OL,12,Ffor multiple counts of sexual abuse,
OL,13,Fincluding two counts of rape, against
OL,14,Ffive boys at Partou King Street nursery
OL,15,Fin Bristol. His crimes were discovered
OL,16,Fafter a CCTV review.
OL,18,FBennett previously worked as an
OL,19,Fapprentice for 18 months at another
OL,20,Fnursery in the Somerset area - which
OL,21,Fthe BBC is not naming ` which does not
OL,22,Fhave CCTV.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
