OL,3,AParents live in fear paedophile nursery
OL,4,Aworker harmed their children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of parents whose children went
OL,7,Fthere said they lived in fear about
OL,8,Fwhat could have happened to them at the
OL,9,Fnursery. The government said a panel
OL,10,Fwas examining the use of CCTV in
OL,11,Fnurseries.
